## Wrong vs right

| Wrong | Right |
|---|---|
| `BMad — Sprint Status (2026-06-19)` | `BMad — Sprint Status` |
| `BMad — Build : 8-4` | `BMad — Build 8-4` |
| Renaming again on turn 2 because the topic “improved” | Keep the existing `BMad — …` title |
| `BMad — Build : Disabled Controls Look` | `BMad — Build : Look contrôles inactifs` (no story ID) |
| `BMad — Correct Course : Réduction de la latence audio` | `BMad — Correct Course : Latence audio` |
| Two chats both named `BMad — Build 8-4` | Second becomes `BMad — Build 8-4 (1)` |
